                                "sense_id": "d88ec1b6-4ec3-394b-be69-eda6dfc248e1",
                                "text": "Cultivating it on a regular basis improves our attitude towards writing and makes us more resilient. But in order to make it work we have to 'unadapt' to the habituation that familiarity can bring, […]"
